       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DATEFORMAT.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-NOW-STR       PIC X(21) VALUE SPACES.
       01 WS-TODAY-YYYYMMDD PIC 9(8) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-DUE-YYYYMMDD  PIC 9(8) VALUE 20261231.
       01 WS-TODAY-INT     PIC 9(7) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-DUE-INT       PIC 9(7) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-DAYS-LEFT     PIC S9(5) VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           MOVE FUNCTION CURRENT-DATE TO WS-NOW-STR.
           MOVE WS-NOW-STR(1:8) TO WS-TODAY-YYYYMMDD.
           COMPUTE WS-TODAY-INT =
               FUNCTION INTEGER-OF-DATE(WS-TODAY-YYYYMMDD).
           COMPUTE WS-DUE-INT =
               FUNCTION INTEGER-OF-DATE(WS-DUE-YYYYMMDD).
           COMPUTE WS-DAYS-LEFT = WS-DUE-INT - WS-TODAY-INT.

           DISPLAY "Today (YYYYMMDD): " WS-TODAY-YYYYMMDD.
           DISPLAY "Due Date        : " WS-DUE-YYYYMMDD.
           DISPLAY "Days Remaining  : " WS-DAYS-LEFT.
           STOP RUN.
